<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3436763375"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6812190560"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Double Wings"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ASCA"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Double Wings"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:38.688"><div begin="00:09.737" end="03:33.455"><p begin="00:09.737" end="00:14.112" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I wonder what you're feeling right now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想知道你现在有何感想</span></p><p begin="00:14.847" end="00:18.707" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">足音響く 独り帰り道<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">脚步声回响在独自回家的路上</span></p><p begin="00:19.266" end="00:23.812" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Ah, you seem like you'd shatter if touched<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你仿佛一触就碎般</span></p><p begin="00:24.239" end="00:28.655" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">冷たい雨 涙隠した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冰冷的雨滴掩盖了泪水</span></p><p begin="00:29.198" end="00:32.147" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">初めて君と出会った場所で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在初次与你相遇的那个地方</span></p><p begin="00:32.782" end="00:38.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">救われた 偽りのない言葉<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你毫无虚假的话语拯救了我</span></p><p begin="00:38.829" end="00:43.013" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">向かい風を睨む鳥のような視線で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的视线恍若睥睨逆风的飞鸟般</span></p><p begin="00:43.337" end="00:47.601" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">I remember 心を貫いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还记得 那种直击心灵的感觉</span></p><p begin="00:48.103" end="00:52.825" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Ah, I want to bring your heart back here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要将你的心带回这里</span></p><p begin="00:53.233" end="00:57.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">二人 濡れる肩抱きながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两人都拥着对方淋湿的肩膀</span></p><p begin="00:57.654" end="01:02.211" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Ah, Let's keep moving forward step by step<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们就这样一步一步前行下去吧</span></p><p begin="01:02.599" end="01:07.154" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">きっと明日は晴れ渡るだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明天一定会是晴朗无云吧</span></p><p begin="01:11.190" end="01:16.759" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">空を見上げ想う I will believe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仰望天空心生思念 我会坚信不疑</span></p><p begin="01:26.693" end="01:31.046" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Ah, what you finally voiced was loneliness<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你终于倾吐而出的心声竟然是孤独</span></p><p begin="01:31.305" end="01:35.742" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">息の音はわずかに滲んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呼吸声微微地溢出唇畔</span></p><p begin="01:36.084" end="01:40.502" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Ah, the ache was almost crushing me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">痛苦的感觉几乎要将我压垮</span></p><p begin="01:41.194" end="01:45.344" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">この両手ですくい上げられたなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多希望我可以用双手将你托举</span></p><p begin="01:46.213" end="01:50.004" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">流れゆくままに生きてきた僕に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让总是随波逐流活在人世的我</span></p><p begin="01:50.191" end="01:54.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">世界の尊さを教えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">知晓何为世界的珍贵</span></p><p begin="01:55.590" end="02:01.129" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">扉開けてそっと連れ出してくれた君だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻轻推开门扉后</span></p><p begin="02:01.785" end="02:04.495" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">I've decided to guide you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经决定要为你引路</span></p><p begin="02:04.905" end="02:14.162" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">La la la ... 僕らの旅は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这场属于我们的旅途</span></p><p begin="02:14.836" end="02:18.986" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">共にあるから 終わらないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正因有彼此相伴 才永远不会终结</span></p><p begin="02:19.594" end="02:22.166" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">君にうたう歌を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将要为你歌唱</span></p><p begin="02:33.911" end="02:38.159" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Ah, 閉じた日記鍵かけた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">合上日记之后将其上锁</span></p><p begin="02:38.853" end="02:42.461" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">窓の隙間 眩しい光<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">窗户缝隙渗进耀眼光芒</span></p><p begin="02:43.267" end="02:46.887" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Ah, I'll stay by your side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会陪伴在你的身旁</span></p><p begin="02:47.158" end="02:52.508" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">もう僕はどこへでも迷わない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论要去往何处我都不会再迷茫</span></p><p begin="02:53.136" end="02:55.643" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">夜明けへ進んでく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朝着黎明迈步前进</span></p><p begin="02:55.643" end="02:59.913" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Ah, I want to bring your heart back here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要将你的心带回这里</span></p><p begin="03:00.474" end="03:04.521" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">二人 濡れる肩抱きながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两人都拥着对方淋湿的肩膀</span></p><p begin="03:04.900" end="03:09.468" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Ah, Let's keep moving forward step by step<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们就这样一步一步前行下去吧</span></p><p begin="03:09.923" end="03:14.529" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">きっと明日は晴れ渡るだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明天一定会是晴朗无云吧</span></p><p begin="03:18.493" end="03:23.642" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">空を見上げ想う I will believe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仰望天空心生思念 我会坚信不疑</span></p><p begin="03:28.748" end="03:33.455" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">君のそばで I think I can believe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你的身旁 我想我定能坚信不已</span></p></div></body></tt>